On behalf of the United States of America, I congratulate the people of Serbia as you celebrate Statehood Day.

Our nations share a long and meaningful history, marked by friendship and mutual respect. The United States is dedicated to building on these strong ties as we work together to expand trade and investment, and to enhance economic prosperity for both our countries. We value Serbia’s partnership in promoting stability and prosperity across the Western Balkans and look forward to deepening our cooperation in the year ahead.